==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

